  "description": "We ask please that you email with more information about yourselves and we will contact you to arrange an appointment to view the property.  Due to the volume of calls we may not be able to respond  to all enquiries. \n\nStunning 4/5 bedroom, 3 bathroom detached log cabin in a wonderful rural setting.  This fantastic property comprises of five bedrooms (two could be used as office/playroom/snug), living room with stove, large open plan kitchen cum dining room, utility room, three bathrooms (including master-en-suite) and master dressing room.  There is a wrap around deck with doors onto decking from the dining room and living room overlooking a forest.  There is a spacious balcony off the master bedroom.\n\nIn addition there is a large garage and car port.\n\nLocated approx. 1 km off the N81 this property can easily access Baltinglass, Dunlavin, Kilcullen, Blessington and Carlow.\n\nThis property is UNFURNISHED with oil heating.\n\nViewing strictly by appointment only.",
